  "contract": "Bells of Light increases Agility, Intellect and hit chance by 3% (rank 1, 801204) or 6% (rank 2, 803842). Effects 0 and 2 are SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_STAT_PERCENTAGE on Agility and Intellect and Player::UpdateStats truncates the stat to an integer. At level 60 the Templar has 132 Agility (135 and 139 with the ranks, ratios 1.023 and 1.053) but only 32 Intellect: rank 1 gives 32.96, which truncates back to 32, so rank 1's Intellect bonus is checked through its stored aura amount, and rank 2 gives 33 (ratio 1.031).",
